Package: comicnest
Version: 1.0.009
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: TerraMaster Community Developer <dev@example.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), systemd
Installed-Size: 0
Description: ComicNest - comic and manga reader for TOS
 Read CBZ, CBR, CB7, ZIP, RAR, TAR, PDF and image folders straight from the
 NAS. Single, double and split-page layouts, right-to-left or left-to-right
 reading, continuous vertical scrolling, zoom, brightness and remembered
 progress. Libraries can point at shared folders or at WebDAV/SMB servers and
 are read on demand without copying the files first.
